    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ATTENTION, </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nemesis Shock is a twin stick shooter focusing on precision movement and creating builds that provide overwhelming firepower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418490/extras/77031b729a88f5c14e5cb033be9cbba9.poster.avif?t=1755544488\" width=800 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418490/extras/77031b729a88f5c14e5cb033be9cbba9.webm?t=1755544488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418490/extras/77031b729a88f5c14e5cb033be9cbba9.mp4?t=1755544488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully refine your mechs' loadout to become a war machine capable of cleaving a path, using quick movement and on the fly decision-making  to find your way through the onslaught of an endless horde of aberrations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418490/extras/8b63b9e2b4d44fe60fcce08e4590647d.poster.avif?t=1755544488\" width=800 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418490/extras/8b63b9e2b4d44fe60fcce08e4590647d.webm?t=1755544488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418490/extras/8b63b9e2b4d44fe60fcce08e4590647d.mp4?t=1755544488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve deeper, fight further, find and destroy the source of the corruption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418490/extras/88b0054042c8e3ef86c5b4af5e921769.poster.avif?t=1755544488\" width=800 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418490/extras/88b0054042c8e3ef86c5b4af5e921769.webm?t=1755544488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418490/extras/88b0054042c8e3ef86c5b4af5e921769.mp4?t=1755544488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple characters each with different subclasses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple stages </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of items </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guns, Rockets, Melee Weapons, and Equipments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unending malignant creatures </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And far greater evil yet to be discovered</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GOOD LUCK, PILOT.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418490/extras/7b8a5b4cc9735c04195de2d6ea493f4f.poster.avif?t=1755544488\" width=800 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418490/extras/7b8a5b4cc9735c04195de2d6ea493f4f.webm?t=1755544488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418490/extras/7b8a5b4cc9735c04195de2d6ea493f4f.mp4?t=1755544488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ATTENTION, </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nemesis Shock is a twin stick shooter focusing on precision movement and creating builds that provide overwhelming firepower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418490/extras/77031b729a88f5c14e5cb033be9cbba9.poster.avif?t=1755544488\" width=800 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418490/extras/77031b729a88f5c14e5cb033be9cbba9.webm?t=1755544488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418490/extras/77031b729a88f5c14e5cb033be9cbba9.mp4?t=1755544488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully refine your mechs' loadout to become a war machine capable of cleaving a path, using quick movement and on the fly decision-making  to find your way through the onslaught of an endless horde of aberrations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418490/extras/8b63b9e2b4d44fe60fcce08e4590647d.poster.avif?t=1755544488\" width=800 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418490/extras/8b63b9e2b4d44fe60fcce08e4590647d.webm?t=1755544488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418490/extras/8b63b9e2b4d44fe60fcce08e4590647d.mp4?t=1755544488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve deeper, fight further, find and destroy the source of the corruption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418490/extras/88b0054042c8e3ef86c5b4af5e921769.poster.avif?t=1755544488\" width=800 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418490/extras/88b0054042c8e3ef86c5b4af5e921769.webm?t=1755544488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418490/extras/88b0054042c8e3ef86c5b4af5e921769.mp4?t=1755544488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple characters each with different subclasses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple stages </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of items </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guns, Rockets, Melee Weapons, and Equipments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unending malignant creatures </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And far greater evil yet to be discovered</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GOOD LUCK, PILOT.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418490/extras/7b8a5b4cc9735c04195de2d6ea493f4f.poster.avif?t=1755544488\" width=800 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418490/extras/7b8a5b4cc9735c04195de2d6ea493f4f.webm?t=1755544488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3418490/extras/7b8a5b4cc9735c04195de2d6ea493f4f.mp4?t=1755544488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
